  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.26 “Independent testing laboratory” means a laboratory, authorized by the commission through a competitive procurement process to perform the functions assigned to it by this chapter.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.17)",
